FACT good_land.take_heed_lest_you_forget(the_growth_list) = ("the growth's list (8:12-13) — 6:10-11's gift made the growth (HI by CALL — the readback row VARIANT): houses built, herds and flocks, silver and gold multiplied; 'silver and gold shall multiply' 8:13 against the king's 'shall not multiply' (17:17 — the same tokens; the king's law's tokens owed to chapter 17): a DATA row", ['accepted'], [('INK', 'Deut 8:12-13 — "lest when you have EATEN AND ARE SATISFIED and have BUILT GOOD HOUSES and dwelt in them, and your HERDS AND YOUR FLOCKS multiply and your SILVER AND GOLD multiply and all that you have multiplies" — "lest you eat and be satisfied" [\'Deut 8:12\']; "good houses you build and dwell" [\'Deut 8:12\'] (28:30 the curse [\'Deut 28:30\']); "your herd and your flock" [\'Deut 8:13\', \'Deut 12:17\', \'Deut 14:23\']; "silver and gold" [\'Deut 17:17\', \'Deut 29:16\', \'Deut 7:25\', \'Deut 8:13\', \'Gen 24:35\', \'Num 22:18\', \'Num 24:13\']; the multiply-verb thrice [\'ירבין\', \'ירבה\', \'ירבה\']'), ('MOVE', "cold_run_hear_o_israel (CALL) — HI.the_gift_and_the_warning(the_list) = the list (6:10-11) — cities, houses, cisterns, vineyards and — 6:10-11's gift (the cities, the houses full of all good, the cisterns, the vineyards and olives 'which you did not …') made THE GROWTH — houses you build, herds and flocks, silver and gold multiplied; the rebellion out of satiety (the Sifrei 43:7, 318:1 — Jeshurun grew fat)"), ('DATA', 'the readback row 8:12-13 VARIANT — computed 18 tokens against 6:10-11\'s 40, 1 shared; the row the_kings_law_tokens: {\'silver_and_gold\': "8:13 \'and your silver and gold SHALL MULTIPLY\' / 17:17 \'silver and gold he SHALL NOT MULTIPLY\' — the same three tokens (the pair\'s seven Torah seats)", \'the_heart\': "8:14 \'and your heart be lifted up\' / 17:20 \'that his heart be not lifted up\' — the lifted heart\'s seats", \'owed\': "the pair\'s CALL when chapter 17 compiles (the king\'s law) — OWED FORWARD (COMPILE_DEBT)"}')])
