FACT firstfruits_ebal_curses.the_curses_of_the_siege_and_the_exile(scattered_among_all_peoples_to_serve_wood_and_stone) = ("scattered among all peoples to serve wood and stone (28:64) — 4:27-28 and Leviticus 26:33 the kin, the Leviticus transfer never fired on the tape (tochacha's stage 5 and obey_horeb's serve wood and stone (4:28) —  by CALL): THE WRITES scattered_among_all_peoples and serving_wood_and_stone_among_nations, HEAVEN entries on Israel at the chapters' own day", ['scattered_among_all_peoples', 'serving_wood_and_stone_among_nations'], [('INK', "Deut 28:64 — 'AND THE LORD WILL SCATTER YOU AMONG ALL PEOPLES, from the end of the earth to the end of the earth, and there YOU SHALL SERVE OTHER GODS which you have not known, you nor your fathers, WOOD AND STONE' — 28:36 shares 8 tokens; 4:28's wood and stone; Leviticus 26:33's scattering"), ('MOVE', "cold_run_tochacha (CALL) — TC.cascade(4)['stage'] = 5 with ['chastised_sevenfold', 'land_desolate', 'scattered_among_nations'] (the fifth gate's land_desolate and scattered_among_nations — ZERO on the running world, counts 0 and 0 UNMOVED: the Leviticus transfer never fired, this line writes its own heaven entry); cold_run_obey_horeb (CALL) — OH.the_exile_case(perish_and_scatter) = perish and scatter (4:26-27) — the case's first ar, (serve_wood_and_stone) = serve wood and stone (4:28) — 28:36 and 28:64 forward; Psalm 115:5 the kin ('28:36 and 28:64 forward') — scattered among all peoples, serving wood and stone — 4:27-28's exile case and Leviticus 26:33's scattering the kin; Onkelos 'peoples worshipping errors'"), ('DATA', "THE WRITES scattered_among_all_peoples and serving_wood_and_stone_among_nations — HEAVEN entries on israel_people at the chapters' own day (DL2); scattered_among_nations and land_desolate ZERO UNMOVED (the Leviticus cell's effects never fired on the tape); the exam's person the exile serving wood and stone — accepted")])
