FACT second_tablets.the_stations_and_the_death(the_stations_reversed) = ("the stations reversed (10:6-7) — Numbers 33:30-34's stations in another order and another form (JO.the_stations('moseroth_seven') by CALL — Moseroth seven camps before Hor): the readback rows VARIANT; Jotbathah's brooks 8:7's phrase, the retelling's addition", ['accepted'], [('INK', 'Deut 10:6-7 — "and the children of Israel journeyed FROM BEEROTH-BENE-JAAKAN TO MOSERAH … from there they journeyed to GUDGODAH, and from Gudgodah to JOTBATHAH, a land of brooks of water" — the station\'s three tokens one lemma [[\'885+\'], [\'885+\'], [\'885\']] (the store\'s split name); Bene-jaakan\'s seats [\'1Chr 1:42\', \'Deut 10:6\', \'Num 33:31\', \'Num 33:32\'], Moserah/Moseroth\'s [\'Deut 10:6\', \'Jer 27:2\', \'Jer 5:5\', \'Num 33:30\', \'Num 33:31\'], Gudgodah/Hor-haggidgad\'s [\'Deut 10:7\', \'Num 33:32\', \'Num 33:33\'], Jotbathah\'s [\'Deut 10:7\', \'Num 33:33\', \'Num 33:34\']; the shared run with Numbers 33:31 1, 33:32 1, 33:33 0 — THE STATIONS IN ANOTHER ORDER AND ANOTHER FORM; "a land of brooks of water" [\'Deut 10:7\', \'Deut 8:7\'] (8:7\'s praise of the good land said of Jotbathah)'), ('MOVE', "cold_run_journeys (CALL) — JO.the_stations(moseroth_seven) = Moseroth seven camps before Mount Hor (33:30-37) — Deuteronomy 10:6's 'there Aaron died' a — Moseroth SEVEN camps before Mount Hor on the list (33:30-37: Moseroth, Bene-jaakan, Hor-haggidgad, Jotbathah, Abronah, Ezion-geber, Kadesh, Mount Hor) — Deuteronomy's Moserah after Bene-jaakan reconciled at the Numbers compile: journeys.DATA['the_deuteronomy_order'] = the_retreat_of_seven_stations"), ('DATA', 'the readback rows 10:6 (the stations) and 10:7 VARIANT by CALL — Moseroth then Bene-jaakan at Numbers 33:30-31, Beeroth-bene-jaakan then Moserah here (one token shared); Gudgod for Hor-haggidgad; Jotbathah\'s brooks the retelling\'s addition (Onkelos "ארע נגדא נחלין דמין" — a land flowing with streams of water); no registry row for any of the four')])
